A few days ago I had this 30th-level-super-hero with 350 HPs, _all_ possible
intrinsics, many spellbooks read (including identify, polymorph, about 10 times
magic mapping), and of course all the useful stuff one can get by polypiling.
Then I had this idea (unfortunately, after finishing the game): is it possible
to win naked, i.e. teleporting down with nothing but intrinsics and spells  
and never touching anything but the AoY while ascending ? Maybe it could have 
worked with that hero; at least I can't see a reason why it shouldn't _in 
principle_ be possible. Surely it is hard work without a weapon, not that good
AC, no magic resistance, no possibility to avoid the endgame,.....
I wonder if anybody has tried this yet. 

PS: I always play with the 'hard'-option on.

